OL,5,G2300 Walker
OL,6,     FTexas Ranger Cordell Walker, a
OL,7,     Fwidowed father-of-two with his own
OL,8,     Fmoral code, returns to Austin,
OL,9,     Fafter two years undercover, only
OL,10,     Fto discover there's harder work to
OL,11,     Fbe done at home.
OL,12,G0000 Walker
OL,13,     FWalker tries to reconnect with his
OL,14,     Ffamily but finds his children
OL,15,     Fsettled into new routines with
OL,16,     FLiam. Back at work, he must
OL,17,     Frecertify as a Ranger, but
OL,18,     Fmemories of Emily hold him back.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
